{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a first-person shooter set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes place 30 years after World War III.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miguel has to go to Rosario, Santa Fe Province to see what happened to a shipment that was supposed to arrive. During the trip, he gets trapped in the city dominated by &quot;Las Serpientes&quot; a group that controls the only bridge between Rosario and Entre Rios, his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Explore detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Cool Rogue,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Mode:</strong> Face off against another player in 1v1 mode and prove you're the toughest in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and discover if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is currently 66% complete and will be updated and updated with new content over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a project made with love and a lot of hard work. If you like what you see, your support helps me continue creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely, Juani from <strong>Milanesa Studio</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3f63358406d9a9670607cca935687d90725191fc.jpg","localized_name":"The lost wagon Act I","name":"The lost wagon A